<content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<div class="os-raise-ib-pset" data-button-text="Check" data-content-id="c5967540-ccdc-40e8-bbd1-e4719c67af69" data-fire-learning-opportunity-event="eventnameY" data-fire-success-event="eventnameX" data-retry-limit="2" data-schema-version="1.0">
  <!--1a-->
  <exercise data-content-id="93136e8c-aab9-46b5-809e-92dca8685ecf" data-problem-type="multiplechoice" data-retry-limit="3" data-solution="\(x^2+3x-4\)" data-solution-options="[&quot;\\(x^2-3x+4\\)&quot;, &quot;\\(-x^2+3x-4\\)&quot;, &quot;\\(x^2+3x-4\\)&quot;, &quot;\\(-x^2-3x+4\\)&quot;]">
    <problem>
      <para>Choose the standard form of the quadratic expression.</para>
        <para> \((x+4)(x-1)\)</para>
          </problem>
    <solution>
      <para>Correct! \(x^2+3x-4\)</para>
    </solution>
    <div class="os-raise-ib-pset-encourage-response">
      <para>Try again. Revisit activities 7.9.3 and 7.9.4. </para>
    </div>
    </exercise>
  <!--1b-->
  <exercise data-content-id="3dc098a3-f2cf-4a46-99c0-6e4ab2f5b443" data-problem-type="multiplechoice" data-retry-limit="3" data-solution="\(6x^2-5x+1\)" data-solution-options="[&quot;\\(6x^2+5x-1\\)&quot;, &quot;\\(6x^2-5x+1\\)&quot;, &quot;\\(-6x^2-5x+1\\)&quot;, &quot;\\(-6x^2+5x-1\\)&quot;]">
    <problem>
      <para> \((2x-1)(3x-1)\) </para>
        </problem>
    <solution>
      <para>Correct! \(6x^2-5x+1\)</para>
    </solution>
    <div class="os-raise-ib-pset-encourage-response">
      <para>Try again. Revisit activities 7.9.3 and 7.9.4. </para>
    </div>
    </exercise>
  <!--2a-->
  <exercise data-content-id="af11d46b-2aed-4e89-b6cc-5632958fb11a" data-problem-type="dropdown" data-retry-limit="1" data-solution="No" data-solution-options="[&quot;Yes&quot;, &quot;No&quot;]">
    <problem>
      <para>Consider the expression \(8-6x+x^2\). </para>
      <para>Is the expression in standard form? </para>
        </problem>
    <solution>
      <para>Correct! No. Even though it has \(x^2\) term, it does not start with the \(x^2\) term.</para>
    </solution>
    <div class="os-raise-ib-pset-encourage-response">
      <para>Try again. Revisit activities 7.9.3 and 7.9.4.</para>
    </div>
    </exercise>
  <!--2b-->
  <exercise data-content-id="d5826ad8-8703-41aa-96ee-3c02dd045b4a" data-problem-type="dropdown" data-retry-limit="1" data-solution="Yes" data-solution-options="[&quot;Yes&quot;, &quot;No&quot;]">
    <problem>
      <para> Is the expression equivalent to \((x-4)(x-2)\)? </para>
        </problem>
    <solution>
      <para>Correct! Yes. Applying the distributive property gives \(x^2-2x-4x+8\) or \(x^2-6x+8\), which is equivalent to \(8-6x+x^2\).</para>
    </solution>
    <div class="os-raise-ib-pset-encourage-response">
      <para>Try again. Revisit activity 7.9.2.</para>
    </div>
    </exercise>
  <!--3a-->
  <exercise data-content-id="b4acb530-d810-4f25-95f7-c2739c0fe041" data-problem-comparator="integer" data-problem-type="input" data-solution="1">
    <problem>
      <para>Find the standard form of the quadratic expression \((x-2)(x+8)\). Use the standard form to answer questions a, b, and c. <para>What is the value of \(a\) in this expression \(ax^2+bx+c\)?</para>
          </para>
      <para> Enter your answer here:</para>
    </problem>
    <solution>
      <para>Correct! \(a\)=1</para>
    </solution>
    <div class="os-raise-ib-pset-encourage-response">
      <para>Try again. Revisit activity 7.9.2. </para>
    </div>
    </exercise>
  <!--2b-->
  <exercise data-content-id="6aee0d16-970b-4113-9c10-b99d81df4403" data-problem-comparator="integer" data-problem-type="input" data-solution="6">
    <problem>
      <para> What is the value of \(b\) in this expression \(ax^2+bx+c\)? </para>
        <para> Enter your answer here:</para>
    </problem>
    <solution>
      <para>Correct! \(b\)=6 </para>
    </solution>
    <div class="os-raise-ib-pset-encourage-response">
      <para>Try again. Revisit activity 7.9.2. </para>
    </div>
    </exercise>
  <!--2c-->
  <exercise data-content-id="cabf4259-4429-448e-b6af-9c1bbdb4f4be" data-problem-comparator="integer" data-problem-type="input" data-solution="-16">
    <problem>
      <para>What is the value of \(c\) in this expression \(ax^2+bx+c\)? </para>
        <para> Enter your answer here:</para>
    </problem>
    <solution>
      <para>Correct! \(c=-16\)</para>
    </solution>
    <div class="os-raise-ib-pset-encourage-response">
      <para>Try again. Revisit activity 7.9.2. </para>
    </div>
    </exercise>
  <!--Do not edit below this line-->
  <solution> </solution>
  <div class="os-raise-ib-pset-encourage-response"> </div>
</div></section>
</content>
